#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Available repairs: %s"
msgstr "Fanamboarana misy: %s"

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown format %s. Use text, json, nagios, or prometheus."
msgstr "Endrika tsy fantatra %s. Ampiasao ny text, json, nagios, na prometheus."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redaction could not complete, so %s was not written."
msgstr "Tsy tontosa ny fanakonana angona miafina, ka tsy voasoratra ny %s."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Wrote %s. Review it before sharing; values after password, secret, token, and community names are masked."
msgstr "Voasoratra ny %s. Jereo alohan'ny hizarana azy; voasarona ny sanda manaraka ny anaran'ny tenimiafina, tsiambaratelo, token, ary community."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Unknown repair"
msgstr "Fanamboarana tsy fantatra"

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Refusing to repair without --yes."
msgstr "Mandà ny hanamboatra raha tsy misy --yes."

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Select a supported symptom and text or JSON output."
msgstr "Misafidiana soritr'aretina tohanana sy vokatra text na JSON."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_web.php
msgid "Accepted warning"
msgstr "Fampitandremana nekena"

#: doctor_access.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Device availability"
msgstr "Fahazoana mifandray amin'ny fitaovana"

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Device permissions could not be evaluated."
msgstr "Tsy azo notombanana ny fahazoan-dalana amin'ny fitaovana."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI cannot run Doctor checks."
msgstr "Tsy afaka manatanteraka ny fanamarinana Doctor ny PHP CLI voakirakira."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Doctor checks failed or exceeded their time limit. Review the Doctor log."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby na nihoatra ny fe-potoana ny fanamarinana Doctor. Jereo ny firaketana Doctor."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Graphs stopped updating"
msgstr "Nijanona tsy navaozina intsony ny tabilao"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Polling is slow"
msgstr "Miadana ny fanangonana angona"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Devices are missing or unavailable"
msgstr "Tsy hita na tsy azo tratrarina ny fitaovana"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Doctor alerts are missing"
msgstr "Tsy hita ny fampitandreman'ny Doctor"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check the poller scheduler and the affected poller log, then verify a new completed cycle."
msgstr "Jereo ny fandaharam-potoanan'ny poller sy ny firaketan'ny poller voakasika, avy eo hamarino ny tsingerina vaovao vita."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection may have stopped."
msgstr "Mety ho nijanona ny fanangonana."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collected values may not be reaching disk."
msgstr "Mety tsy tonga any amin'ny kapila ireo sanda voangona."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Inspect the output queue and Boost flush history; verify that the queue drains and RRD timestamps advance."
msgstr "Jereo ny filaharana mivoaka sy ny tantaran'ny fanadiovana Boost; hamarino fa ritra ny filaharana ary mandroso ny marik'oran'ny RRD."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check storage capacity, runtime-directory permissions and the last RRD update; account for deferred writes."
msgstr "Jereo ny fahafahan'ny fitehirizana, ny fahazoan-dalana amin'ny lahatahiry fampandehanana ary ny fanavaozana RRD farany; raiso an-tsaina ireo fanoratana nahemotra."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "RRD storage needs investigation."
msgstr "Mila fanadihadiana ny fitehirizana RRD."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection work may be exceeding its time budget."
msgstr "Mety mihoatra ny fe-potoana nomena azy ny asan'ny fanangonana."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare cycle duration with the polling interval and inspect device timeouts before increasing concurrency."
msgstr "Ampitahao amin'ny elanelam-potoan'ny fanangonana ny faharetan'ny tsingerina ary jereo ny fe-potoana tapitra ho an'ny fitaovana alohan'ny hampitomboana ny fampiarahana asa."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare database counters during a slow cycle and inspect query plans before changing server limits."
msgstr "Ampitahao ireo kaontera ao amin'ny tahiry angona mandritra ny tsingerina miadana ary jereo ny drafitry ny fangatahana alohan'ny hanovana ny fetran'ny mpizara."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Database pressure may be contributing to slow polling."
msgstr "Mety ho anisan'ny mahatonga ny fanangonana miadana ny tsindry amin'ny tahiry angona."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection prerequisites or reachability may be failing."
msgstr "Mety tsy mahomby ireo fepetra takian'ny fanangonana na ny fahafahana mifandray."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify the affected device permissions, reachability, credentials and assigned poller using Cacti diagnostics."
msgstr "Hamarino amin'ny alalan'ny fitiliana Cacti ny fahazoan-dalana, ny fahafahana mifandray, ny mombamomba ny fanamarinana ary ny poller voatendry ho an'ny fitaovana voakasika."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Scheduled checks or mail delivery need attention."
msgstr "Mila fanaraha-maso ny fanamarinana voalahatra na ny fandefasana mailaka."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify scheduling and recipient settings, inspect retained delivery attempts, and send a Cacti test email."
msgstr "Hamarino ny fikirakirana ny fandaharam-potoana sy ny mpandray, jereo ireo andrana fandefasana notehirizina, ary mandefasa mailaka fanandramana Cacti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Possible causes require verification; matching checks do not establish a root cause."
msgstr "Mila fanamarinana ireo mety ho antony; tsy manaporofo ny tena fototry ny olana ireo fanamarinana mifanaraka."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "No cause is established by the available observations. Run fresh diagnostics and investigate the symptom directly."
msgstr "Tsy misy antony voaporofo avy amin'ireo fanamarihana misy. Manaova fitiliana vaovao ary hadihadio mivantana ilay soritr'olana."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "At least 24 hours since server startup and FLUSH STATUS. Counters are cumulative and may have different reset histories; confirm trends during a representative workload before tuning."
msgstr "Farafahakeliny 24 ora hatramin'ny nanombohan'ny mpizara sy ny FLUSH STATUS. Mitambatra hatrany ireo kaontera ary mety samy hafa ny tantaran'ny famerenana azy; hamarino ny fironana mandritra ny vesatra asa mahasolo tena alohan'ny hanitsiana."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative tuning advice is deferred: obtain valid uptime and at least 24 hours since startup and FLUSH STATUS. Missing metrics or an inconsistent sample cannot establish database health."
msgstr "Nahemotra ny torohevitra fanitsiana mitambatra: makà fe-potoana fampandehanana marina sy farafahakeliny 24 ora hatramin'ny fanombohana sy ny FLUSH STATUS. Tsy afaka manaporofo ny fahasalaman'ny tahiry angona ireo metrika tsy ampy na santionany tsy mifanaraka."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database observation window"
msgstr "Fe-potoana fanaraha-maso ny tahiry angona"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection metrics are unavailable or invalid. Check access to SHOW GLOBAL STATUS and SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; do not treat missing metrics as an idle server."
msgstr "Tsy hita na tsy manankery ireo metrika fifandraisana. Jereo ny fidirana amin'ny SHOW GLOBAL STATUS sy SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; aza raisina ho toy ny mpizara tsy miasa ireo metrika tsy ampy."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Current connections: %.0f / %.0f (%s); recorded peak: %.0f (%s of the current limit)."
msgstr "Fifandraisana ankehitriny: %.0f / %.0f (%s); tampon'isa voarakitra: %.0f (%s amin'ny fetra ankehitriny)."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection pooling and poller concurrency. Check database-host memory headroom before raising max_connections; the historical peak may reflect an older limit."
msgstr "Avereno jerena ny fitambaran'ny fifandraisana sy ny fampiarahana asan'ny poller. Jereo ny fahafahan'ny fitadidian'ny mpampiantrano tahiry angona alohan'ny hampitomboana ny max_connections; mety ho fetra taloha no taratry ny tampon'isa ara-tantara."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection capacity"
msgstr "Fahafahan'ny fifandraisana"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB buffer pool reads"
msgstr "Famakiana ao amin'ny buffer pool InnoDB"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans and the working set. Consider innodb_buffer_pool_size only after measuring memory available on the database host; a cumulative miss ratio alone does not prove memory pressure."
msgstr "Avereno jerena ny drafitry ny fangatahana sy ny angona ampiasaina. Hevero ny innodb_buffer_pool_size aorian'ny fandrefesana ny fitadidiana misy eo amin'ny mpampiantrano tahiry angona ihany; tsy manaporofo ny tsindry amin'ny fitadidiana irery ny taham-pahadisoana mitambatra."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "On-disk temporary tables"
msgstr "Tabilao vonjimaika an-kapila"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans, sorting, grouping, and temporary-table data types before changing memory limits. Some tables must use disk; memory limits and accounting differ between MySQL and MariaDB versions."
msgstr "Avereno jerena ny drafitry ny fangatahana, ny fandaharana, ny fanakambanana ary ny karazana angona amin'ny tabilao vonjimaika alohan'ny hanovana ny fetran'ny fitadidiana. Tsy maintsy mampiasa kapila ny tabilao sasany; samy hafa ny fetran'ny fitadidiana sy ny fanisana eo amin'ny kinova MySQL sy MariaDB."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection thread creation"
msgstr "Famoronana thread fifandraisana"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection reuse and thread_cache_size. Check the server thread-handling mode before tuning; thread-pool implementations do not behave like one-thread-per-connection servers."
msgstr "Avereno jerena ny fampiasana indray ny fifandraisana sy ny thread_cache_size. Jereo ny fomba fitantanana thread an'ny mpizara alohan'ny hanitsiana; tsy mitovy fihetsika amin'ny mpizara thread iray isaky ny fifandraisana ireo fampiharana thread-pool."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review slow-query logging, long_query_time, and query plans before changing server buffers. This counter depends on the configured slow-query threshold and does not identify individual statements."
msgstr "Avereno jerena ny firaketana fangatahana miadana, ny long_query_time, ary ny drafitry ny fangatahana alohan'ny hanovana ireo buffer-n'ny mpizara. Miankina amin'ny fetran'ny fangatahana miadana voakirikira ity kaontera ity ary tsy manondro baiko tsirairay."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Slow statements"
msgstr "Baiko miadana"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient."
msgstr "Nahemotra ny torohevitra mitambatra mandra-pahampy ny fe-potoana fanaraha-maso."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Thread-cache advice is not assessed: thread_handling is unavailable or is not one-thread-per-connection. Review the active thread-pool implementation instead."
msgstr "Tsy voamarina ny torohevitra momba ny cache-n'ny thread: tsy hita ny thread_handling na tsy one-thread-per-connection. Avereno jerena kosa ny fampiharana thread-pool miasa."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Required counters are missing or invalid: %s, %s. Check server-version support and monitoring permissions."
msgstr "Tsy hita na tsy manankery ireo kaontera ilaina: %s, %s. Jereo ny fanohanan'ny kinovan'ny mpizara sy ny fahazoan-dalana fanaraha-maso."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A counter reset since the prior sample; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Nisy kaontera naverina tamin'ny voalohany hatramin'ny santionany teo aloha; manangòna elanelam-potoana mahasolo tena hafa alohan'ny hanitsiana."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Insufficient activity: %.0f %s; at least %d observations are needed for this advisory."
msgstr "Tsy ampy ny hetsika: %.0f %s; ilaina farafahakeliny fanamarihana %d ho an'ity torohevitra ity."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Counters are inconsistent or were reset independently. Collect a new representative sample before tuning."
msgstr "Tsy mifanaraka ireo kaontera na naverina tamin'ny voalohany mitokana. Manangòna santionany vaovao mahasolo tena alohan'ny hanitsiana."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The interval sample is too small or counters reset; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Kely loatra ny santionan'ny elanelam-potoana na naverina tamin'ny voalohany ireo kaontera; manangòna elanelam-potoana mahasolo tena hafa alohan'ny hanitsiana."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Interval %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); fetra fanadihadiana: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Mitambatra %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); fetra fanadihadiana: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This counter can omit memory-mapped temporary files on MySQL; a low ratio does not rule out disk use."
msgstr "Mety tsy hanisa ny rakitra vonjimaika voasoritra an-tadidy ao amin'ny MySQL ity kaontera ity; tsy manilika ny fampiasana kapila ny tahan'isa ambany."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Redo-log advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient and Innodb_log_waits is available."
msgstr "Nahemotra ny torohevitra redo-log mandra-pahampy ny fe-potoana fanaraha-maso sy ahitana ny Innodb_log_waits."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."
msgstr "Innodb_log_waits mitambatra: %.0f."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Investigate transaction sizes, log-buffer pressure, and storage latency. Recheck the rate under load before considering innodb_log_buffer_size; this historical count is not evidence of a current stall."
msgstr "Hadihadio ny haben'ny fifanakalozana, ny tsindry amin'ny buffer-n'ny firaketana, ary ny fahatarana amin'ny fitehirizana. Hamarino indray ny taham-piasana ao anatin'ny vesatra alohan'ny hieritreretana ny innodb_log_buffer_size; tsy porofon'ny fijanonana ankehitriny ity isa ara-tantara ity."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB log-buffer waits"
msgstr "Fiandrasana ny log-buffer InnoDB"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "installed Cacti composer.json"
msgstr "composer.json an'ny Cacti napetraka"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cacti %s installer requirement"
msgstr "Fepetra takian'ny mpanapetraka Cacti %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP compatibility with installed Cacti"
msgstr "Fifanarahana PHP amin'ny Cacti napetraka"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; installed Cacti %s."
msgstr "Mampiasa PHP %s; Cacti %s napetraka."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Could not establish Cacti's PHP requirement. Check the installed Cacti composer.json or release documentation; Doctor does not assume compatibility."
msgstr "Tsy afaka namaritra ny fepetra PHP takian'ny Cacti. Jereo ny composer.json an'ny Cacti napetraka na ny tahirin-kevitry ny famoahana; tsy manao vinavina fifanarahana ny Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s and < %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s ary < %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP meets that requirement."
msgstr "Mitaky %s (%s). Mahafeno izany fepetra izany ny PHP mandeha ankehitriny."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP does not meet that requirement."
msgstr "Mitaky %s (%s). Tsy mahafeno izany fepetra izany ny PHP mandeha ankehitriny."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Detected %s; Doctor requires Cacti 1.2.20 or newer."
msgstr "Hita ny %s; mitaky Cacti 1.2.20 na vaovao kokoa ny Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported Cacti version"
msgstr "Kinova Cacti tohanana"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP upstream security support"
msgstr "Fanohanana ara-piarovana avy amin'ny loharanon'ny PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This checks the PHP release branch, not whether this patch release is up to date or whether your OS vendor backports fixes. Cacti compatibility is checked separately."
msgstr "Manamarina ny sampana famoahana PHP ity, fa tsy hoe vaovao ity kinova fanitsiana ity na mamerina fanitsiana ny mpamatsy OS anao. Hamarinina mitokana ny fifanarahana amin'ny Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; upstream security-support status is unknown or this is a prerelease. Check https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php and update Doctor's support data."
msgstr "Mampiasa PHP %s; tsy fantatra ny satan'ny fanohanana ara-piarovana avy amin'ny loharano na kinova mialoha ity. Jereo ny https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php ary havaozy ny angona fanohanan'ny Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s receives upstream security fixes through %s."
msgstr "Mampiasa PHP %s; ny PHP %s dia mahazo fanitsiana fiarovana avy amin'ny loharano hatramin'ny %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s no longer receives upstream security fixes; support ended %s. Upgrade to a supported PHP branch compatible with your Cacti installation, or confirm security maintenance with your OS vendor."
msgstr "Mampiasa PHP %s; ny PHP %s dia tsy mahazo fanitsiana fiarovana avy amin'ny loharano intsony; nifarana tamin'ny %s ny fanohanana. Manavao amin'ny sampana PHP tohanana mifanaraka amin'ny fametrahana Cacti anao, na hamarino amin'ny mpamatsy OS anao ny fikojakojana ara-piarovana."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required current CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Fanitarana PHP CLI ankehitriny ilaina"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required web PHP extensions"
msgstr "Fanitarana PHP tranonkala ilaina"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing: %s. Install them through the operating system package manager."
msgstr "Tsy ampy: %s. Apetraho amin'ny alalan'ny mpitantana fonosan'ny rafitra fiasa izy ireo."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "All PHP extensions required by the Cacti installer are loaded in this PHP context."
msgstr "Voatahiry ao anatin'ity tontolo PHP ity avokoa ireo fanitarana PHP rehetra takian'ny mpanapetraka Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor does not execute configured binaries while running as root."
msgstr "Tsy mampandeha ireo rakitra azo tanterahina voakirikira ny Doctor rehefa mandeha amin'ny maha root."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The file name %s is not expected for %s, so Doctor did not execute it."
msgstr "Ny anaran-drakitra %s dia tsy andrasana ho an'ny %s, koa tsy nampandehan'ny Doctor izany."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running as root, so permission checks describe root rather than the web server or poller account, configured binaries are not executed, and repairs are refused. Run Doctor as the Cacti poller user."
msgstr "Mandeha amin'ny maha root ny Doctor, koa mamaritra ny root fa tsy ny mpizara tranonkala na ny kaonty poller ny fanamarinana fahazoan-dalana, tsy mandeha ireo rakitra azo tanterahina voakirikira, ary lavina ny fanamboarana. Alefaso amin'ny maha mpampiasa poller Cacti ny Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor privileges"
msgstr "Fahazoan-dalan'ny Doctor"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running without root privileges."
msgstr "Mandeha tsy misy fahazoan-dalana root ny Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Fanitarana PHP CLI ilaina"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable is unavailable, so its extensions cannot be checked."
msgstr "Tsy hita ilay rakitra azo tanterahina PHP CLI voakirikira, koa tsy azo hamarinina ireo fanitarany."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "shell_exec() is disabled, so Doctor cannot compare the CLI PHP extensions with Cacti requirements."
msgstr "Tsy mandeha ny shell_exec(), koa tsy afaka mampitaha ireo fanitarana PHP CLI amin'ny fepetra takian'ny Cacti ny Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable did not return a valid extension list."
msgstr "Tsy namerina lisitra fanitarana manankery ilay rakitra azo tanterahina PHP CLI voakirikira."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing from CLI PHP: %s. The web and CLI PHP configurations are separate on many systems."
msgstr "Tsy ampy ao amin'ny PHP CLI: %s. Misaraka ny fikirakirana PHP tranonkala sy CLI amin'ny rafitra maro."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI has every extension required by Cacti."
msgstr "Manana ny fanitarana rehetra takian'ny Cacti ilay PHP CLI voakirikira."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "GD TrueType support"
msgstr "Fanohanan'ny GD TrueType"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Recommended PHP features"
msgstr "Fomba fiasa PHP atoro"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unavailable: %s. Cacti can run without these features, but related functionality may be limited."
msgstr "Tsy misy: %s. Afaka mandeha tsy misy ireo fomba fiasa ireo ny Cacti, saingy mety ho voafetra ireo fiasa mifandraika aminy."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The optional gettext, SNMP, and GD TrueType features are available."
msgstr "Misy ireo fomba fiasa tsy voatery gettext, SNMP, ary GD TrueType."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "memory_limit is %s (%dM or more is recommended)"
msgstr "memory_limit dia %s (%dM na mihoatra no atoro)"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "max_execution_time is %d seconds (60 or more is recommended)"
msgstr "max_execution_time dia %d segondra (60 na mihoatra no atoro)"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "date.timezone is not set"
msgstr "tsy voafaritra ny date.timezone"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unset"
msgstr "tsy voafaritra"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s. Current values: %s"
msgstr "%s. Sanda ankehitriny: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP runtime configuration"
msgstr "Fikirakirana fampandehanana PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database connection"
msgstr "Fifandraisana amin'ny tahiry angona"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Query failed: %s"
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fangatahana: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A read-only query completed successfully."
msgstr "Vita soa aman-tsara ny fangatahana famakiana ihany."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The database returned an unexpected result."
msgstr "Namerina vokatra tsy nampoizina ny tahiry angona."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Doctor could not determine the database server version from %s."
msgstr "Tsy afaka namaritra ny kinovan'ny mpizara tahiry angona avy amin'ny %s ny Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported database server"
msgstr "Mpizara tahiry angona tohanana"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s %s detected; this Cacti branch recommends %s %s or newer."
msgstr "%s %s no hita; ity sampana Cacti ity dia manoro %s %s na vaovao kokoa."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database character set is %s and collation is %s. Cacti requires utf8mb4."
msgstr "Ny character set an'ny tahiry angona dia %s ary ny collation dia %s. Mitaky utf8mb4 ny Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "tsy fantatra"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database character set"
msgstr "Character set an'ny tahiry angona"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database timezone support"
msgstr "Fanohanana faritr'ora an'ny tahiry angona"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The Cacti database account cannot read mysql.time_zone_name. Grant SELECT access and populate the database timezone tables."
msgstr "Tsy afaka mamaky ny mysql.time_zone_name ny kaonty tahiry angona Cacti. Omeo fidirana SELECT ary fenoy ireo tabilao faritr'oran'ny tahiry angona."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The database timezone table is accessible and contains %d entries."
msgstr "Azo idirana ny tabilao faritr'oran'ny tahiry angona ary misy fidirana %d."

#: doctor_functions.php
