#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Scheduled checks are disabled. Enable them in Settings > Doctor to retain samples and alert on changes."
msgstr "Tsy alefa ny fanamarinana voalahatra. Alefaso ao amin'ny Fikirakirana > Doctor izany mba hitahirizana santionany sy handefasana fampandrenesana rehefa misy fiovana."

