msgstr "Fandefasana fampandrenesana"

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d check transitions await delivery; attempts: %d of 3."
msgstr "Fiovana fanamarinana %d no miandry fandefasana; fanandramana: %d amin'ny 3."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Automatic retries exhausted. Correct Cacti mail settings, then run Doctor with --scheduled --retry-alerts as the poller user."
msgstr "Lany ny fanandramana mandeha ho azy. Ahitsio ny fikirakirana mailaka Cacti, dia alefaso amin'ny --scheduled --retry-alerts ny Doctor amin'ny maha-mpampiasa poller."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "Next eligible retry: %s UTC, after a primary poller cycle."
msgstr "Fanandramana manaraka azo atao: %s UTC, aorian'ny tsingerin'ny poller fototra iray."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "No alert recipients are currently configured; pending transitions are retained."
msgstr "Tsy misy mpandray fampandrenesana voakirakira amin'izao fotoana izao; tazonina ireo fiovana miandry."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "No retained alert is awaiting delivery. Mail-server acceptance does not prove inbox delivery."
msgstr "Tsy misy fampandrenesana voatazona miandry fandefasana. Ny faneken'ny mpizara mailaka dia tsy manaporofo ny fahatongavana ao amin'ny boaty fandraisana."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor retained status changes (UTC). Repeated changes for one check are coalesced; an out-and-back transition is retained."
msgstr "Fiovan'ny sata voatazon'ny Doctor (UTC). Atambatra ny fiovana miverimberina ho an'ny fanamarinana iray; tazonina ny fiovana mivoaka sy miverina."

